## FILE 2 — `terraform/main.tf`

### Change A — Lines 12 to 21 (the `appgw_ssl_certificates` local block)

**FIND this (lines 12–21):**
```hcl
  # SSL certificates for Application Gateway (Argocd only)
  # Referencing .secret_id directly (instead of a string interpolation) lets Terraform
  # automatically order: KV cert upload → AppGW ssl_certificate block.
  appgw_ssl_certificates = local.argocd_domain_is_present ? [
    {
      name                = replace(try(local.aks.argocd_domain, ""), ".", "-")
      key_vault_secret_id = azurerm_key_vault_certificate.argocd_ssl_certificate[0].secret_id
    }
  ] : []
}
```

**REPLACE WITH:**
```hcl
  # SSL certificates for Application Gateway (ArgoCD only)
  # Uses versionless_secret_id so AppGW auto-rotates without a Terraform re-apply.
  # References the data source (cert already exists in KV — no PFX import needed).
  appgw_ssl_certificates = local.argocd_domain_is_present ? [
    {
      name                = replace(try(local.aks.argocd_domain, ""), ".", "-")
      key_vault_secret_id = data.azurerm_key_vault_certificate.argocd_ssl_certificate[0].versionless_secret_id
    }
  ] : []
}
```

> Key change on line 18: `azurerm_key_vault_certificate` → `data.azurerm_key_vault_certificate`
> and `.secret_id` → `.versionless_secret_id`

